irection.","The 10m branch uses the archived candle predicates and RSI of open, with 80 and 75 thresholds as authored. Daily display inputs have no dependency into either order branch. The 10m chart is built from exchange-published 5m candles. Market orders use the next 10m open.","Only complete candles inside each UTC window are used. Each window resets indicator warm-up and position state. The 15m RSI adds the full, separate June 2022 month because its native and equal windows yield no closed trades.","Flat zero-volume exchange bars stay in the indicator series and are validated against their zero quote volume and trade count. No order in the verified cashflow test fills on a zero-volume bar.","BTC matches the archived venue and contract. ETH is a comparable same-venue perpetual; pooled drawdown normalizes to independent 10000 USDT capital per market."],"source_audits":{"183":{"published_source_settings":{"start":"2022-04-15 00:00:00","end":"2022-05-14 23:59:00","period":"12h","basePeriod":"15m","exchanges":"[{\"eid\":\"Futures_Binance\",\"currency\":\"BTC_USDT\"}]"},"source_document_sha256":"aef7341d11d879c3449abc425927780e0a27d3693b44647f4df1245fa4ffa0aa","source":"https://github.com/fmzquant/strategies/blob/7853bb2bf262c4567ac238d3552d97f0e50cb801/CCI-MTF-ObOs.md","closed":4,"windows_utc":{"FMZ native complete bars":["2022-04-15T00:00:00+00:00","2022-05-14T12:00:00+00:00"],"Next equal window":["2022-05-14T12:00:00+00:00","2022-06-13T00:00:00+00:00"]}},"240":{"published_source_settings":{"start":"2022-02-06 00:00:00","end":"2022-05-06 00:00:00","period":"2h","basePeriod":"15m","exchanges":"[{\"eid\":\"Bitfinex\",\"currency\":\"BTC_USD\"}]"},"source_document_sha256":"41d4aa2aed7a2db03c6e6c5d4b05a4298c134b6816613326cc0855dabd31bf9a","source":"https://github.com/fmzquant/strategies/blob/7853bb2bf262c4567ac238d3552d97f0e50cb801/Demark-Reversal-Points.md","archived_active_evidence":["res = input.int(title='Resolution', defval='18000')","src = request.security(syminfo